{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24030","headline":"再授宾客分司 · 白居易","name":"再授宾客分司","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"优稳四皓官，清崇三品列。\n伊予再尘忝，内媿非才哲。\n俸钱七八万，给受无虚月。\n分命在东司，又不劳朝谒。\n既资闲养疾，亦赖慵藏拙。\n宾友得从容，琴觞恣怡悦。\n乘篮城外去，系马花前歇。\n六游金谷春，五看龙门雪。\n吾若默无语，安知吾快活。\n吾欲更尽言，复恐人豪夺。\n应爲时所笑，苦惜分司阙。\n但问适意无，岂论官冷热。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24030.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24030","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}